# 🐍 PERSONAL EXPENSE / STUDENT MANAGEMENT CLI

A Python-based Command Line Interface (CLI) application for managing personal expenses and student records using SQLite.

## 📌 Project Overview

The Personal Expense / Student Management CLI is a Python application that allows users to manage daily expenses and student information through a simple terminal interface.

It uses SQLite to store records permanently in a local database.

## 🎯 Project Objectives

- Learn Python programming.
- Understand SQLite database integration.
- Practice CRUD operations.
- Manage personal expenses.
- Store and organize student records.
- Build a practical command-line application.

## 🚀 Features

### 💰 Personal Expense Management

- Add new expenses.
- View all expenses.
- Update existing expenses.
- Delete expenses.
- Categorize expenses.
- Calculate total expenses.
- Track expense history.

### 🎓 Student Management

- Add new students.
- View all students.
- Search students by ID.
- Update student information.
- Delete student records.
- Store student details.

