## ⚙️ Installation & Setup

### Step 1: Install Python

Download Python from:

https://www.python.org/downloads/

### Step 2: Verify Python Installation

```bash
python --version
```

### Step 3: Create Project Folder

```bash
mkdir PERSONAL-EXPENSE-STUDENT-CLI
cd PERSONAL-EXPENSE-STUDENT-CLI
```

### Step 4: Run the Application

```bash
python main.py
```

**Note:** Python's sqlite3 module is included in standard Python installations. No separate SQLite Python package is normally required.

