## 💰 Expense Management

| Operation | Description |
|---|---|
| Add Expense | Add a new expense |
| View Expenses | Display all expenses |
| Update Expense | Modify expense details |
| Delete Expense | Remove an expense |
| Total Expenses | Calculate total spending |
| Expense History | Display previous expenses |

### Example Expense Record

```text
Expense ID: 1
Title: Food
Amount: 500
Category: Daily Needs
Date: 2026-11-22
```

## 🎓 Student Management

| Operation | Description |
|---|---|
| Add Student | Register a new student |
| View Students | Display all students |
| Search Student | Find a student |
| Update Student | Modify student information |
| Delete Student | Remove a student record |

### Example Student Record

```text
Student ID: 101
Name: Ahmad
Age: 16
Class: 10
City: Narowal
```

## 🗄️ SQLite Database

The project uses SQLite to save information in a database file.

### Expenses Table

```sql
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS expenses (
    id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,
    title TEXT NOT NULL,
    amount REAL NOT NULL,
    category TEXT,
    date TEXT
);
```

### Students Table

```sql
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS students (
    id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,
    name TEXT NOT NULL,
    age INTEGER,
    class TEXT,
    city TEXT
);
```

## 🐍 Python SQLite Connection

```python
import sqlite3

connection = sqlite3.connect("management.db")

cursor = connection.cursor()

print("Database connected successfully!")

connection.close()
```

